  ['Why do I need the ISTQB® certificate?', 'The ISTQB® Certified Tester certificate is the most important basis for a software tester. With the certificate, you demonstrate competence, inspire confidence and give your IT career a boost!'],
  ['What happens to my data?', 'We treat the data you provide in accordance with the requirements of the GDPR and use it exclusively to inform you about our upcoming webinars on software testing and to maintain contact. You have the right at any time to request information about the data we have stored about you, to have it corrected or to request its deletion.'],
  ['Insurance and torts', 'Our work in this field includes: litigation, research and legal opinions, peaceful settlements.'],
